  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Loner Hong Yu accepts three and a half million lava bats and says that with those bats his Hong Yu blessed land would not need to dump lava into the ground every month. Narration states that each blessed land’s door is different, and that this mini sun is Hong Yu blessed land’s entrance. The bats descend into the sun and enter the land. Gui Wang says that since Loner Hong Yu accepted the bats, it means he agreed to barge into Lang Ya Blessed Land with him. Loner Hong Yu affirms the promise and says that a month later they will get to Lang Ya blessed land.",
      "chapters": [
        446
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
