      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The blessed land’s entrance is a mini sun that engulfs a radius of a few hundred li in bright red light; a jade bridge stretches out from that sun. Each blessed land’s door is different, and this mini sun is Hong Yu blessed land’s entrance.",
